      "id": 103,
      "__component": "macro-components.sticky-steps-section",
      "badge": "How it works",
      "heading": "Connect n8n in 4 steps",
      "description": "Set up once — every future submission triggers your workflow automatically.",
      "background": "#f9fafb",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": 312,
          "title": "Create a workflow in n8n",
          "description": "In n8n, create a new workflow, click Add Node and search for Webhook, set the HTTP method to POST, and copy the generated webhook URL.",
          "rawHtml": "<div class='raw-html-embed'><div style='font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:320px;'><div style='border:1px solid #eaecf0;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(15,14,26,.06);padding:13px;'><div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#101828;'>n8n workflow</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:10.5px;padding:7px 10px;background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #eaecf0;border-radius:8px;margin:5px 0;'><span style='font-weight:600;color:#101828;'>Trigger</span><span style='color:#9777e0;'>→</span><span style='color:#475467;'>Formester — Submission created</span></div><div style='font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:#101828;margin:8px 0 4px;'>Webhook URL</div><div style='border:1px solid #eaecf0;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 11px;font-size:10px;color:#98a2b3;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;'>https://hooks.n8n.io/abc123</div><div style='margin-top:11px;'><span style='font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;background:#6434d0;border-radius:7px;padding:7px 16px;line-height:1;'>Copy URL</span></div></div></div></div>",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "id": 314,
          "title": "Add the webhook in Formester",
          "description": "Open your form, go to Automate → Webhooks → Add Webhook, paste the copied URL, tick the same event you chose, and save.",
          "rawHtml": "<div class='raw-html-embed'><div style='font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:320px;'><div style='border:1px solid #eaecf0;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(15,14,26,.06);padding:13px;'><div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#101828;'>Add Webhook</div><div style='font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:#101828;margin:8px 0 4px;'>Endpoint Url<span style='color:#e02b2b;'>*</span></div><div style='border:1px solid #eaecf0;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 11px;font-size:10px;color:#98a2b3;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;'>https://hooks.n8n.io/abc123</div><div style='font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:#101828;margin:9px 0 5px;'>Select Event To Listen To</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:10.5px;color:#101828;margin:5px 0;'><span style='width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:4px;background:#6434d0;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;'><svg width='9' height='9' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='3' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M5 12l4 4L19 6'/></svg></span>Created [Submission.Created]</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:10.5px;color:#475467;margin:5px 0;'><span style='width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:4px;border:1.5px solid #cdd5df;flex-shrink:0;'></span>Updated [Submission.Updated]</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:10.5px;color:#475467;margin:5px 0;'><span style='width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:4px;border:1.5px solid #cdd5df;flex-shrink:0;'></span>Deleted [Submission.Deleted]</div><div style='margin-top:11px;'><span style='font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;background:#6434d0;border-radius:7px;padding:7px 16px;line-height:1;'>Add Webhook</span></div></div></div></div>",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "id": 311,
          "title": "Build your actions in n8n",
          "description": "Back in n8n, add the apps or services you want to connect as the next steps and map the incoming Formester fields to each action.",
          "rawHtml": "<div class='raw-html-embed'><div style='font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:320px;'><div style='border:1px solid #eaecf0;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(15,14,26,.06);padding:13px;'><div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#101828;'>n8n actions</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:10.5px;padding:7px 10px;background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #eaecf0;border-radius:8px;margin:5px 0;'><span style='font-weight:600;color:#101828;'>Full name</span><span style='color:#9777e0;'>→</span><span style='color:#475467;'>CRM — Lead name</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:10.5px;padding:7px 10px;background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #eaecf0;border-radius:8px;margin:5px 0;'><span style='font-weight:600;color:#101828;'>Work email</span><span style='color:#9777e0;'>→</span><span style='color:#475467;'>CRM — Email</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:10.5px;padding:7px 10px;background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #eaecf0;border-radius:8px;margin:5px 0;'><span style='font-weight:600;color:#101828;'>Plan</span><span style='color:#9777e0;'>→</span><span style='color:#475467;'>Sheet — Column C</span></div><div style='margin-top:11px;'><span style='font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;background:#6434d0;border-radius:7px;padding:7px 16px;line-height:1;'>Save workflow</span></div></div></div></div>",
          "image": null
        },
